    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. so if i'm looking at our lithium-ion cell imports specifically, we've been having these weird issues where the shipments arrive but the actual count is slightly off from what was on the manifest, or there are more damages than the usual percentage. how should i adjust the safety stock math to account for those kinds of unexpected discrepancies or \"hidden\" losses in the supply chain?",
